"description":"Caring Village is the all-in-one app for family caregivers. Coordinate medications, schedules, tasks, and documents — and keep your whole care circle in the loop — without the chaos of texts, spreadsheets, and missed calls. Whether you're managing an aging parent's care from across the country or coordinating with siblings across town, Caring Village keeps everyone on the same page.\n\nWhy Caring Village?\n\nCaregiving is rarely one person's job — but it often ends up that way. Multiple schedules, medications to track, documents to find, decisions to make together. Caring Village brings it all into one secure, family-focused platform so you can spend less time managing logistics and more time being present.\n\nKey Features:\n\nJulia – Your AI Caregiving Assistant\nMeet Julia, your AI-powered caregiving assistant. Available anytime, Julia answers questions, offers guidance, and helps families make more informed decisions throughout the caregiving journey.\n\nAdvanced Medication Management\nSet detailed medication reminders, track adherence, and share updates with your care circle. No more wondering if a dose was taken.\n\nShared Care Calendar\nKeep everyone aligned with a shared calendar that syncs with external calendars so appointments don't slip through the cracks.\n\nPrintable Care Calendar\nExport and print calendars for offline use or to share with doctors and family members.\n\nTask Lists\nCreate and assign tasks to care circle members. Family members can volunteer for responsibilities — so caregiving is shared, not shouldered alone.\n\nExpert-Curated Checklists\nAccess checklists built by caregiving experts to guide you through complex situations, from daily routines to emergency planning.\n\nCustomizable Care Plans\nDesign care plans tailored to your loved one's specific needs, with flexible reminders to stay on track.\n\nWellness Journal\nTrack moods, symptoms, and milestones. Share photos and updates with your care circle, where family members can like, comment, and stay emotionally connected — even from a distance.\n\nSecure Document Storage\nStore and organize medical records, insurance forms, and legal documents in one secure hub. Everything in one place when you need it most.\n\nBuilt for Families Who Share the Load\n\nCaregiving doesn't have to fall on one person. Caring Village makes it easy for your whole family to step in — volunteer for tasks, track medications, read updates — so the load is shared and nothing gets missed. Whether your family lives under one roof or across time zones, you'll have the tools to stay aligned, divide responsibilities, and show up for each other.\n\nWho Is Caring Village For?\n\n\nFamily caregivers supporting aging parents\nSpouses and partners managing chronic conditions\nFamilies coordinating care across multiple households\nAnyone who wants to get organized and share the caregiving load\n\n\nOver 85,000 families use Caring Village to coordinate care and keep everyone in it.\n\nDownload today and see what organized caregiving looks like.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://caringvillage.com/privacy-policy/\nTerms & Conditions: https://caringvillage.com/terms-conditions/", "minimumOsVersion":"17.0", "price":0.00, "trackId":1093814557, "releaseNotes":"Fixed an issue where recurring events in the calendar were not being removed consistently.", "userRatingCount":36}, 
