"description":"Herde makes it easier to organize care — and even easier for your people to show up.\n\nWhether you're running a meal train for a new baby, coordinating postpartum recovery, or organizing support after a loss, Herde brings everything your village needs into one place. Create a Herde for yourself or someone you care about, share what would be helpful, and invite friends and family to pitch in.\n\nFOR THE PEOPLE ORGANIZING CARE\nSet up meals and other ways to help, share preferences and important details, and keep everyone coordinated without endless texts or back-and-forth.\n\nFOR THE PEOPLE SHOWING UP\nHerde makes helping simple. See exactly what's needed, find all the details in one place, volunteer for a specific need or let Herde automatically choose one for you, and use direct links to order meals, groceries, gifts, and more.\n\nWITH HERDE, YOU CAN:\n\n- Organize meals and everyday help\n- Share preferences and the details that matter\n- Coordinate care in one simple calendar\n- Give people the option to choose a need or auto-volunteer\n- Make it easy to send support with direct ordering links\n- Share other meaningful ways to show up\n- Keep your whole village connected in one place\n\nLess asking. More showing up.", "minimumOsVersion":"16.4", "price":0.00, "trackId":6794079226, 
"releaseNotes":"- Inviting your herde is easier. Share invites directly from the Overview and Members tabs.\n- Copy a slot’s delivery address with one tap and paste it into your favorite delivery app.\n- Meal slots now default to 5:00–6:00 PM.\n- Cover photos are now displayed in full on the Herde Info screen.\n- Enjoy smoother date selection when creating a herde.\n- Fixed an issue where the keyboard covered the “Save Changes” button when editing a herde.", "userRatingCount":6}, 
